# ============================================================
# plan: rest_from_ambient -- pump down from ambient, then seal and rest
# ============================================================
# Leaves the chamber sealed under rough vacuum with nothing running, so it can
# rest there. No orbit and no thermal control.
#
# Start: ambient. The chamber at atmosphere with its door closed. The turbo
#   pump is not running (its path has never been run).
# End:   sealed below 3 Torr. Every valve closed, both pumps and both zones off.
#   The controller may then be turned off; the chamber holds its vacuum.
# Fails: the chamber is not at atmosphere at the start, or does not reach 3 Torr
#   within 20 minutes. Either way, rLACO ends any pumping it started.
#
# Typical: 743 to 3.4 Torr took 6 minutes (2026-10-01).

load rLACO
record every 5 s

begin at ambient
pumpdown to 3 Torr
log sealed below 4 Torr; the chamber may rest

